From: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 08:44:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 066/211] dt-bindings: gpu: img: add the Allwinner A733
 BXM-4-64

The Allwinner A733 integrates an Imagination BXM-4-64 MC1 GPU. Add the SoC
specific compatible in front of the generic BXM-4-64 one.

Signed-off-by: Jernej Skrabec <jernej.skrabec@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
index e9218e0f363..3c658926300 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/gpu/img,powervr-rogue.yaml
@@ -37,6 +37,7 @@ properties:
           - const: img,img-rogue
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-gpu
               - thead,th1520-gpu
           - const: img,img-bxm-4-64
           - const: img,img-rogue
-- 
